rooms_desc ({"This is Taz's main room of his house.  The floor stretches as far as theeye can see.  The room is decorated in a gothic style mainly in the colorblack.  Large omnious black pillars hold up the ceiling, which seems to be one large mirror.  To the northwest there is a pool, crowded with beautifulwomen.  The blonde is naked, the brunette is wearing a bathing suit of fish-netand the black haired sex-kitten is lying on the floor completelynaked.Nearby the pool is a bed.  In the opposite corner of the room, guys crowdaround video games, seemingly oblivious to the fact of the beautiful nymphomaniac harem which is just a short walk away.  This room is also Taz'smakeshift bedroom, you look to the south and see a beatuiful black lace curtainblocking the view of what seems to be a beatiful girl lying on a bed.  Tazwould be very angry to find out you were looking at his sex-kitten. So you decide not to stare anymore.","This is Taz's pool hall, You look around the dimly lit room and see about four pool tables.  There are some girls at one of the tables, and peoplecrowded around a small bar.  Behind the bar there is a large sign.... Maybeyou should look at it.. :-)  Behind the bar is a beautiful barmaid, Taz onlyhires women to work for him for some strange reason !?!?!  People sit at small tables and drink away their troubles, gossip fills the air almost asmuch as smoke does... In the midst of the tables, there is a slightly raised platform on which Wynonna Rider is performing a strip tease for Taz and his friends... Other than this, it's a pretty dull room.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Taz's main room.","A small room in Taz's house, it seems to be a pool hall.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
